Package: spuriouscorr
Title: Simulate and Visualize Spurious Correlations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Austin", "Pearce", email = "austinwpearce@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for simulating XY data with various patterns
    (linear trends, cloud/potato, U-shaped, star-shaped) and visualizing
    them with a dark Tron-like ggplot theme. Useful for teaching about
    spurious correlations and regression.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    tibble,
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
